<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Seardel cautions on management buyout.</title>
<headline>Seardel cautions on management buyout.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Seardel Investment Corp Ltd, an investment holding company, said on Thursday that its chairman Aaron Searli and a consortum of senior management were considering plans to acquire all the investments owned by Seardel.</p>
<p>The move could result in Seardel becoming a cash shell company or being delisted.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
